---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { LINKS, SITE } from '../consts';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Elif Ece Can.">
	<div>
		<PageHeader title="About" />

		<div class="prose max-w-[62ch]">
			{/* TODO(Ece): replace with your own text. Two or three short paragraphs is plenty. */}
			<p>
				I am an MSc student in Computer Engineering at Politecnico di Torino,
				with a BSc from Bilkent University. My research is in software
				engineering: a characterisation study of defect benchmarks and evaluation
				bias in automated program repair, and separately, using LLM agents to
				automate build and test environment setup for open-source software.
			</p>
			<p>
				Architecture is a hobby of mine, and it has turned into a line of side
				projects applying computer vision to it. Two so far: one mapping
				architectural style similarity across 25 traditions in CLIP latent space,
				the other measuring how much of Le Corbusier’s Five Points survives being
				built in a different climate.
			</p>
		</div>

		<section class="mt-14">
			<h2 class="mb-5 text-[0.8rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-faint">Elsewhere</h2>
			<ul class="space-y-2 text-[0.9rem]">
				<li>
					<a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="text-ink underline decoration-accent underline-offset-4">
						{SITE.email}
					</a>
				</li>
				{
					LINKS.map((l) => (
						<li>
							<a href={l.href} class="text-ink underline decoration-accent underline-offset-4">
								{l.label}
							</a>
						</li>
					))
				}
			</ul>
		</section>
	</div>
</Base>
